### Terminal Fast Lookups

```bash
sudo kubeadm certs check-expiration
sudo openssl x509 -in /etc/kubernetes/pki/apiserver.crt -noout -text | grep -A 2 "Validity"
sudo kubeadm certs renew apiserver
```

