## Commands to Practice

```bash
# 1. Check all certificate expiration dates
./check-certs.sh

# 2. Inspect a specific certificate with OpenSSL
sudo openssl x509 -in /etc/kubernetes/pki/apiserver.crt -noout -enddate

# 3. Renew the API server certificate
./renew-apiserver-cert.sh apiserver

# 4. Verify post-renewal expiration
./test-pki-certs.sh
```
